      "message": "refactor(2d): clippy-clean comparisons in the open-edge band law (#1735)\n\nThe NaN-safe negated comparisons become explicit is_nan / is_finite\ntests, and the wall pair gets a type alias. A run with no heights is\nnow refused as not level. No other behaviour change.\n\nRefs #1735\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
